      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm helping my kid with some school stuff. Can you explain what the actual scientific consensus is regarding gender identity and how it relates to biological sex? Like, what does the science actually say about the two? Or are they the same thing? Or different? help me out. weightings",
